      "name": "s_a_music_frontend_that_feels_closer_to_a_mainstre",
      "value": "A music frontend that feels closer to a mainstream streaming service"
    },
    {
      "name": "s_our_philosophy_is_to_make_the_experience_feel_cl",
      "value": "Our philosophy is to make the experience feel closer to a mainstream music streaming platform, not just a local music player. Covers, recommendations, albums, and artists are right there when you open the app; playback, queue, lyrics, search, and playlists sit where you expect them. The interface stays restrained, the motion is smooth, and the hierarchy is clear. Your music stays on your own server: no cloud account, no single-backend lock-in. GuoBeng and Navidrome/Subsonic are both supported, and guest mode lets you browse servers that do not allow sign-in."
    },
